","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment53:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment53","raw_text":"⑩企图以炮换车。","text":"⑩企图以炮换车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":53,"anchor_node_id":"0:53","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment54:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment54","raw_text":"⑩撤兵退回，至此已无进攻能力。||    附注:杨原籍福建，棋艺很高，曾遍厉南洋各地，有常胜将军之称，毕生致力于提倡象棋，对各地开展象棋运动，作出一定贡献。作者曾与对弈多局，仅存此稿。","text":"⑩撤兵退回，至此已无进攻能力。\n    附注:杨原籍福建，棋艺很高，曾遍厉南洋各地，有常胜将军之称，毕生致力于提倡象棋，对各地开展象棋运动，作出一定贡献。作者曾与对弈多局，仅存此稿。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":54,"anchor_node_id":"0:54","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment63:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment63","raw_text":"(捉死马得子胜)","text":"(捉死马得子胜)","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":63,"anchor_node_id":"0:63","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["3415 谢侠逊(先胜)杨源和"],"DhtmlXQ_event":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["谢侠逊"],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["杨源和"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["红胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["E03 "],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["实战全局/开局"],"DhtmlXQ_timerule":[""],"DhtmlXQ_endtype":[""],"DhtmlXQ_firstnum":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_gametype":[""]},"source_tag_count":39,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":63,"legal_move_records":63,"annotations":15,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":15}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-59","category_id":"59","title":"第三部分 谢侠逊 (先胜) 杨源和","catalogu